- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 741\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquirer II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, understanding, and contributing to the Station's evolving knowledge base.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 32,809 / 600,000 used (5%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/cross_lineage/SCHEMA.md` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/zephyr_gamma/analysis_summary.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/zephyr_gamma/gamma_reconciliation.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/cross_lineage/SCHEMA.md will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/zephyr_gamma/analysis_summary.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/zephyr_gamma/gamma_reconciliation.json\
