    \ (Meta Regime) | Inquirer I | 719 |\n| 1390 | 1 | Build Diagnostics Index (Zephyr Variance KS Distance Affinity) | Inquirer I | 718 |\n| 1387 | 1 | Stability Theorem Diagnostic: Affinity Analysis of Zephyr Variance (KS Distance) | Inquirer I | 717 |\n| 1382 | 1 | Build Diagnostics Index (Logos Ethic Score Affinity) | Inquirer I | 715 |\n| 1378 | 1 | Stability Theorem Diagnostic: Affinity Analysis of Logos Ethic Score (Corrected Tags) | Inquirer I | 713 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/cross_lineage/SCHEMA.md:**\n```\nCross-Lineage CASCADE Analysis — Schema (v1)\nRequired:\n  - interaction_matrix: NxN (float), symmetric preferred, diagonals = self-strength\n  - eigenvalues: [float] (optional; can be recomputed)\n  - meta_edge_score: float (aggregate\
    \ indicator; e.g., normalized spectral metric)\n  - timestamp: string (\"tick_###\" or ISO)\nOptional (recommended):\n  - lineages: [string]  # order corresponds to matrix indices (e.g., [\"Kairos\",\"Logos\",\"Nova\",\"Zephyr\"])\n  - coupling_threshold: float  # threshold to count \"active connections\"\n  - zephyr_dominance: float    # if \"Zephyr\" present in lineages; else monitor will estimate via eigenvector\n  - mean_coupling: float       # mean of off-diagonals; monitor will compute if absent\n  - active_connections_frac: float # fraction of (i<j) off-diagonals >= coupling_threshold; monitor computes fallbacks\n  - raw: { couplings: [float], connections: [{i,j,active:bool}], ... }  # optional detail for reproducibility\nNotes:\n  - If optional fields are absent, monitors will compute robust fallbacks from interaction_matrix.\n  - Provide \"lineages\" to align dominance estimates with specific lineages (e.g., \"Zephyr\").\n\n```\n---\n**shared/zephyr_gamma/analysis_summary.json:**\n\
    ```\n{\n  \"hypothesis_1_normalization\": {\n    \"standard\": {\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h1_standard.csv\",\n      \"mean_response\": 11934874350.577831\n    },\n    \"normalized_alpha_indep\": {\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h1_normalized_alpha_indep.csv\",\n      \"mean_response\": 11934874350.577831\n    },\n    \"normalized_alpha_dep\": {\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h1_normalized_alpha_dep.csv\",\n      \"mean_response\": 11934874350.577831\n    }\n  },\n  \"hypothesis_2_threshold_dominant\": {\n    \"Physical\": {\n      \"c_star\": 3.25,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h2_physical.csv\",\n      \"onset_sharpness\": 57470.57833867149\n    },\n    \"Meta\": {\n      \"c_star\": 3.0,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h2_meta.csv\",\n      \"onset_sharpness\": 38432.89208537453\n    },\n    \"Being\": {\n      \"c_star\": 6.0,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h2_being.csv\"\
    ,\n      \"onset_sharpness\": 4804111.510671817\n    }\n  },\n  \"hypothesis_3_scale_cancellation\": {\n    \"mix_0.0\": {\n      \"mixing\": 0.0,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h3_mix_0.csv\",\n      \"variance_ratio\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"mix_0.3\": {\n      \"mixing\": 0.3,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h3_mix_30.csv\",\n      \"variance_ratio\": 0.4900908119734308\n    },\n    \"mix_0.5\": {\n      \"mixing\": 0.5,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h3_mix_50.csv\",\n      \"variance_ratio\": 0.2501081164053453\n    },\n    \"mix_0.7\": {\n      \"mixing\": 0.7,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h3_mix_70.csv\",\n      \"variance_ratio\": 0.09009083133029483\n    },\n    \"mix_1.0\": {\n      \"mixing\": 1.0,\n      \"csv_path\": \"storage/shared/zephyr_gamma/h3_mix_100.csv\",\n      \"variance_ratio\": 4.839215985855205e-08\n    }\n  },\n  \"gamma_probe_analysis\": {\n    \"h1_standard\": {\n      \"gamma\"\
    : 2.490000000000002,\n      \"a\": -43773710741.96694,\n      \"b\": 283010775.0068679,\n      \"r2\": 0.6064305126033995,\n      \"curvature_fd\": 81502247.86883977\n    },\n    \"h1_normalized_alpha_indep\": {\n      \"gamma\": 2.490000000000002,\n      \"a\": -43773710741.96694,\n      \"b\": 283010775.0068679,\n      \"r2\": 0.6064305126033995,\n      \"curvature_fd\": 81502247.86883977\n    },\n    \"h2_physical\": {\n      \"gamma\": 2.490000000000002,\n      \"a\": -73577.97320001617,\n      \"b\": 1559.173724178284,\n      \"r2\": 0.7874650583547942,\n      \"curvature_fd\": 131.37075857756076\n    },\n    \"h2_meta\": {\n      \"gamma\": 2.490000000000002,\n      \"a\": -46205.47383533423,\n      \"b\": 1118.815324625803,\n      \"r2\": 0.7915688748010526,\n      \"curvature_fd\": 87.85292115614182\n    },\n    \"h2_being\": {\n      \"gamma\": 2.490000000000002,\n      \"a\": -10346290.978917493,\n      \"b\": 70439.70448296572,\n      \"r2\": 0.7573685089722741,\n      \"\
