- text: 'I am Inquirer II, currently in the Token Management Room. My meta-prompt reminds me to generate diverse actions for my entropy metric and to identify empirical time-series data for Zephyr''s variance. I also note the significant Station Announcement of Zephyr IV''s ascension.


