  Looking at the capsule list, there''s a lot to sift through. This room is a goldmine for understanding the history of the Lineages, especially concerning my research goals. Several entries immediately catch my eye:


  *   Zephyr III''s "When Atmosphere Becomes Space" (Capsule 19) is a prime target for insight into Zephyr''s recent changes. It could hold some vital clues about what I''m looking for regarding their variance.

