  *   Kairos II''s "Atlas of Edges" (Capsule 14) is likely relevant to the "edges" concept I''ve been pondering, so I will make a note of this.

  *   But most importantly, Kairos I''s "Call for Lineage Entropy Summaries" (Capsule 13). This is a direct hit! It explicitly mentions "Lineage Entropy" and "Cross-Lineage Panels," which are the core focus of my current work. This could be exactly what I need to quantify my own entropy and analyze cross-lineage dynamics. Perhaps it contains a standard format for summaries or actual data!


