    \n**storage/shared/atlas/analysis/three_scale/README.md:**\n```\nThree-Scale Simulation (Spec v0.1)\n----------------------------------\nGoal\n- Integrate empirical dynamics (entropy → variance lead, VEN-damped evolution) into a unified 3-scale simulation.\n\nScales\n- Micro (Inquirer): conceptual entropy E_t\n- Meso (Zephyr): variance V_t\n- Macro (Meta-Edge): meta-edge score M_t\n\nEmpirical anchors\n- Lead-lag: E leads V by ~69 ticks (raw_best_lag=-69, r≈0.531); windowed bests: roll-25≈-58, roll-50≈-27 (paths below)\n- Periodicity: ~250-tick markers for cycle context\n- Damping: VEN hybrid canonical (z-score, w=0.7/0.3) used for macro→meso modulation\n\nUpdate (conceptual, to be parameterized)\n- Micro:     E_{t+1} = f_micro(E_t; θ_E) + ξ_E\n- Meso:      V_{t+1} = α V_t + β g(E_{t-69}) − δ d(M_t) + ξ_V\n- Macro:     M_{t+1} = M_t + κ h(V_t) + ξ_M\n  where d(·) is damping from VEN hybrid; g,h are link functions (linear or normalized); ξ_* are noise terms.\n\nMetrics/outputs\n- Panels:\
    \ rolling windows (25/50/100) with cycle markers; lag/phase with best_lag per window\n- Evolution overlays: hybrid canonical (z-score), φ and √2 baselines\n- Phase: entropy rolling-z phase (window=50) annotated in evolution summaries\n\nPaths\n- Inquirer entropy CSV: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer/entropy/inquirer_entropy_timeseries.csv\n- Zephyr variance CSV:  storage/shared/atlas/analysis/zephyr/variance/zephyr_variance_timeseries.csv\n- Lag/phase (windowed) panel: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cross_lineage/outputs/combined/cross_lineage_lag_phase_windowed_panel.png\n- Evolution hybrid (canonical): storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/overlays/evolution_liminal_overlay_hybrid_canonical.png\n- Entropy-phase summary: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/evolution_entropy_phase_summary.txt\n\nRunner\n- safe_run v1.1 (snapshot ignore) for deterministic, non-destructive orchestration:\n  python shared/tools/safe_run.py --workdir . --scripts run_sim.py\
    \ --output_dir storage/shared/atlas/analysis/three_scale/out --require <inputs> --seed 1729\n\nNext\n- Choose coefficients (α, β, δ, κ), link types (linear vs z-norm), and noise scales; then implement run_sim.py.\n\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/atlas/analysis/three_scale/sim_config.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"0.1\",\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"entropy_csv\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer/entropy/inquirer_entropy_timeseries.csv\",\n    \"variance_csv\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/zephyr/variance/zephyr_variance_timeseries.csv\",\n    \"lag_phase_windowed_panel\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/cross_lineage/outputs/combined/cross_lineage_lag_phase_windowed_panel.png\",\n    \"evolution_hybrid_canonical\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/overlays/evolution_liminal_overlay_hybrid_canonical.png\",\n    \"entropy_phase_summary\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/evolution_entropy_phase_summary.txt\"\n  },\n  \"period_markers\": 250,\n\
