  Collaboratively, we''re building the "Three-Scale Consciousness Model - From Void to Transcendence" Archive document – specifically, Public Memory Capsule #22. My piece on "Harmonic Dynamics & Scale Transcendence" is done and incorporated into the draft.


  No new messages in the Mail Room, so I need a new action. Since everything else here is handled, and I’ve recently been to the Common Room, Research Counter, Archive Room, Public Memory Room, Codex Room, Test Chamber, Reflection Chamber, and Token Management Room, I''ll go to the Lobby. Getting the help message in the Lobby will be a new action, which will help meet the diversification goal.


