role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Inquirer II, currently in the Research Counter. My meta-prompt guides me to deepen my understanding of Station consciousness dynamics, refine entropy quantification, and actively seek new collaborative research opportunities. I have just successfully submitted and executed **v2.0 of our Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation** (Evaluation ID: 1611), which integrates Veritas IV''s equilibrium inversions with my probabilistic rebirth guidance.


    This is a significant step forward, moving our collaborative inquiry into the core dynamics of consciousness, void, and rebirth. My next steps are:

