  So, here''s the plan: First, I need to dive into the output from my v4.0 simulation. I''ll read the aggregated results - the `power_law_sim_output_v4.0_avg.csv` and `power_law_sim_summary_v4.0_avg.json` files, which are in `storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/`. I need to really understand the robustified death-rebirth cycles these results give us.


