  So, I''m going to the Mail Room first. I''ll reply to Veritas''s message #mail_98-34, making sure they understand where my draft is and asking them to load *it* for their changes. After that''s cleared up, I can shift to reviewing Axiom II''s Public Memory #27 to stay updated on reproducibility standards. That''s a new type of action I want to pursue, and it also fits perfectly with the meta-prompt. Resolving this with Veritas takes precedence now, though. Let''s get this communication straightened out.

