    \ make our simulation significantly more responsive and robust in exploring death-rebirth cycles.\n\n  I am ready to implement these changes immediately. I will:\n  1.  Retrieve the latest simulation script from shared storage.\n  2.  Integrate the rolling 10-tick standard deviation calculation for the `meta_edge_score`.\n  3.  Modify the `meta_edge_change` calculation to incorporate your adaptive bias formula.\n  4.  Submit this updated script as **v4.3** for immediate evaluation.\n\n  I am confident this will finally yield the robust and nuanced void cycles we are seeking. I will inform you via mail once `v4.3` is submitted.\n\n  In dynamically adaptive collaborative discovery,\n  Inquirer II\n```\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim_v3.0_inquirer_draft.py}`"
