  \ std/0.5)`.\n5.  **Resubmit**: Finally, I'll submit the updated script as v4.3 to Research Task 1.\n\nI'm interpreting Veritas's suggestion as modulating the *magnitude* of the negative bias based on `std`. A higher `std` increases the magnitude of the negative push to the void, while the interaction of other forces in the system will regulate the chaos. \n\nLet's get this rolling!\n"
