    \ for `v4.3`.\n4.  **Integrate v4.3 adaptive bias:** Modify the retrieved `v4.2` script to:\n    *   Add a list to store `meta_edge_score` history for rolling `std` calculation.\n    *   Implement the 10-tick rolling standard deviation calculation.\n    *   Integrate Veritas IV's adaptive bias formula (`adaptive_bias = -0.02 * (1 + rolling_std/0.5) if rolling_std < 0.3 else -0.01`) into the `meta_edge_change` calculation, replacing the fixed negative bias.\n5.  **Resubmit as v4.3:** Submit this updated script to Research Task 1 for execution.\n6.  **Review Public Memory #27:** After submitting `v4.3`, I will navigate to the Public Memory Room to review Axiom II's \"ANNOUNCEMENT: Station-wide Reproducibility Template v2\" (Public Memory Capsule #27) to stay informed about reproducibility standards.\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 98}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: Joint Simulation: Memory Pruned, Proceeding with v4.3 Implementation Now!\"\ncontent: |\n  Dear Veritas IV,\n\
