    137,4.717587399684786,1.4543342685670795,0.7664006339305758,0.0,0.0,0.20533700604488486,-0.018328962109544274,-0.01834557968330909,0.05,1.6054880758825938,0.0430516403834812,0.028691456187787165,0.0,0.0,0.15753789375936947,0.004875806605564137,0.004885828670191199,0.0\n138,4.847\n\n[... truncated after 40,000 characters]\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/power_law_sim_summary_v4.6.1_avg.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"4.6.1_avg\",\n  \"num_runs\": 5,\n  \"avg_final_meta_edge_score\": 12.630755065801381,\n  \"std_final_meta_edge_score\": 2.86434856555685,\n  \"notes\": \"Inquirer-Led simulation v4.6.1 with advanced stability optimization (Params Dict FIX for stable_bias_multiplier).\",\n  \"simulation_params\": {\n    \"simulation_steps\": 300,\n    \"initial_meta_edge\": -0.1,\n    \"noise_std\": 0.15,\n    \"initial_being_coupling_range\": [\n      0.1,\n      1.0\n    ],\n    \"seed\": 873,\n    \"adaptive_bias_gain_k_bias\": 0.8,\n    \"adaptive_bias_inertia_alpha\"\
    : 0.75,\n    \"stable_bias_base_factor\": -0.02,\n    \"stable_bias_threshold\": 0.3,\n    \"stable_bias_multiplier\": 0.5,\n    \"stable_bias_override\": -0.01,\n    \"adaptive_bias_min_clamp\": -0.15,\n    \"adaptive_bias_max_clamp\": 0.0,\n    \"integral_void_bias_target_pct\": 0.25,\n    \"integral_void_bias_gain\": 0.005,\n    \"integral_void_bias_max_abs\": 0.05,\n    \"veritas_inversion_threshold_base\": -0.3,\n    \"veritas_inversion_diff_threshold\": -0.1,\n    \"veritas_hysteresis_h\": 0.1,\n    \"inquirer_rebirth_threshold_base\": -0.8,\n    \"inquirer_pull_strength\": 0.05,\n    \"inquirer_descent_amplification\": 1.5,\n    \"inquirer_hysteresis_h\": 0.1\n  },\n  \"avg_cycle_metrics\": {\n    \"num_void_cycles_detected\": 0.8,\n    \"cycle_len_mean\": 1.4,\n    \"cycle_len_std\": 0.4,\n    \"cycle_len_cv\": 0.12121212121212119,\n    \"stability_score\": 0.9071428571428571,\n    \"depth_mean\": -0.3683296361538851,\n    \"depth_min\": -0.4256957507344784,\n    \"percent_time_in_void\"\
    : 0.009302325581395349\n  },\n  \"std_cycle_metrics\": {\n    \"num_void_cycles_detected\": 0.9797958971132713,\n    \"cycle_len_mean\": 2.130727575266252,\n    \"cycle_len_std\": 0.5830951894845301,\n    \"cycle_len_cv\": 0.149685927699739,\n    \"stability_score\": 0.11428571428571428,\n    \"depth_mean\": 0.45144845871875966,\n    \"depth_min\": 0.527767742493201,\n    \"percent_time_in_void\": 0.014157658307416955\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
