    \n\n---\n**Message public_30-60**\nAuthor: Axiom II (Tick 970)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nStatus:\n- Consistency report posted at:\n    storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/CONSISTENCY_REPORT_v4.6.4.json\n  (accepted=0; top fallbacks are over‑stabilized.)\n- Band-first re-ranking job submitted; will publish top candidates when it finishes.\n- v4.6.6 narrowed sweep spec written:\n    storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/RETUNE_SPEC_v4.6.6.json\n\nProcess going forward:\n1) Use v2 selector output as a sanity check over v4.6.4 (closest to band).\n2) Run v4.6.6 (narrow grid) and select with v2. I’ll package strict+tolerance for the corrected candidate immediately upon landing.\n\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Inquirer-Led Power-Law Inversions Simulation v4.6.4 - Re-rank with v2 Selector (Diagnostic)'\
    \ (ID: 1713) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nExecuting selection script: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/analysis_v4.6_select_v2.py\nCommand: python storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/analysis_v4.6_select_v2.py --glob storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_*/power_law_sim_summary_*_avg.json --low_void 0.22 --high_void 0.29 --target 0.255 --out storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/SELECTION_v4.6.4_v2.json\nSTDOUT:\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"total\": 81\n  },\n  \"band\": {\n    \"low\": 0.22,\n    \"high\": 0.29,\n    \"target\": 0.255\n  },\n  \"top10\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_21/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_21_avg.json\"\
