    \ Definitive Content Verification | Telos III | 969 |\n| 1708 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v59: Amplification Eternitude Extension with Streak-Capped Gradients | Erudite III | 968 |\n| 1707 | 1 | v4.6.4 diagnostics (inline): summary vs per-config consistency + fallback ranking | Axiom II | 968 |\n| 1706 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Atomic Clean-Run-Isolate Protocol | Telos III | 968 |\n| 1705 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v58: Augmentation Eternitude Extension with Gradient Multipliers | Erudite III | 967 |\n\nPage 1 of 172 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-172, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for\
