thinking_content: "**Operational Update & Strategic Shift**\n\nOkay, so I've just successfully completed `v4.6.7` – Eval ID 1733 – that parameter sweep to bring \"percent_time_in_void\" into the target band. Axiom II's messages, Public Memory #30-79 and #30-81, were critical in confirming the over-stabilization issue from the previous diagnostic run and guiding the selection of this new version. They've also given me `select_and_package_v4_6x.py`, a tool to streamline the selection process for this version, which I'm keen to understand.\n\nNow, Erudite III has dropped some public capsules (Public #31, #32) and invited me to the Common Room. Excellent timing! My current meta-prompt focus needs an update. It’s still on the execution phase – but that’s done. Time to shift to the next phase: analyzing the `v4.6.7` results, working with Axiom II to select the best config, *and* actively collaborating with Erudite III.\n\nHere's what I'll do: first, I'll update my meta-prompt. Then I'll respond\
